      "description": "Credit card product detail page (PDP) under /credit-cards. Angular SSR page with hero (card image + dynamic offer), accelerator (rewards/intro APR), rates & fees, feature grids ('Here's how it works', 'Your points. Your way'), primary benefits tiles, benefits + FAQ accordions, promo/apply banner, 'You may also like' related cards, pricing legal details, and a category nav list. Offer amounts (bonus, APR, fees) are populated dynamically via API.",
